	(text "Rotator controller\nRoot sheet. rotor_drive is the triac page. drive_mcu is the Drive.\nanalog_input is the pot front end and the VIN_RECT warning.\nThe power sheet is not drawn. +5V and AC_FUSED stay no-connects for that.\n+3V3 and ROTOR_RETURN join the sheets that use them.\nDo not copy hardware/controller/ (imported V4). It stays as reference."
